%% Read Path Data Flow - Multi-Layer Caching Strategy
%% Version: 1.0.0
%% Date: 2025-10-27
%% Description: Complete read path with cache-aside pattern implementation

graph LR
    Client[Client Application<br/>Browser/Mobile]
    API[API Gateway<br/>Request Handler]
    EdgeCache[Edge Cache<br/>Vercel/Cloudflare<br/>TTL: 60s]
    ServiceLayer[Service Layer<br/>Business Logic]
    AppCache[Application Cache<br/>Redis L1<br/>TTL: 300s]
    ServiceCache[Service Cache<br/>In-Memory<br/>TTL: 60s]
    RepoLayer[Repository Layer<br/>Data Access]
    QueryCache[Query Cache<br/>Redis L2<br/>TTL: 600s]
    DBReadReplica[(Read Replica<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    DBPrimary[(Primary Database<br/>PostgreSQL)]

    Client -->|1. GET /api/content/123| API

    API -->|2. Check Edge Cache| EdgeCache
    EdgeCache -->|3a. Cache HIT| API
    EdgeCache -->|3b. Cache MISS| ServiceLayer

    ServiceLayer -->|4. Check App Cache| AppCache
    AppCache -->|5a. Cache HIT| ServiceLayer
    AppCache -->|5b. Cache MISS| ServiceCache

    ServiceCache -->|6a. Cache HIT| AppCache
    ServiceCache -->|6b. Cache MISS| RepoLayer

    RepoLayer -->|7. Check Query Cache| QueryCache
    QueryCache -->|8a. Cache HIT| RepoLayer
    QueryCache -->|8b. Cache MISS| DBReadReplica

    DBReadReplica -->|9. Execute Query| DBReadReplica
    DBReadReplica -->|10. Return Data| RepoLayer

    RepoLayer -->|11. Store in Query Cache| QueryCache
    RepoLayer -->|12. Return Data| ServiceLayer

    ServiceLayer -->|13. Store in Service Cache| ServiceCache
    ServiceLayer -->|14. Store in App Cache| AppCache
    ServiceLayer -->|15. Return Data| API

    API -->|16. Store in Edge Cache| EdgeCache
    API -->|17. Return Response| Client

    Note1[Cache Hit Rate: ~85%<br/>Average Latency: 50ms<br/>DB Load: 15% of requests]

    style Client fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px
    style API fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
    style EdgeCache fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2,stroke-width:3px
    style AppCache fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:3px
    style ServiceCache fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    style QueryCache fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:3px
    style DBReadReplica fill:#4caf50,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style DBPrimary fill:#4caf50,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ServiceLayer fill:#2196f3,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style RepoLayer fill:#9e9e9e,stroke:#616161,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style Note1 fill:#fffde7,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
